-- Searches the Creator Store through Open Cloud: POST /toolbox-service/v2/assets:search
-- Needs an executor with an HTTP request function (request / http_request / syn.request).
-- Everything you insert is client-side, only you can see it.
--
-- API KEY: do NOT upload this file with the key inside to a public repo.
-- For a public loadstring, run this first in the executor instead:
--   getgenv().LarperApiKey = "YOUR_KEY"

